WEBVTT

00:38.930 --> 00:41.850
<i>Wh-What the heck?!</i>

00:41.850 --> 00:45.100
<i>I've encountered a Mie-san-turned-cat 
on my way home from school.</i>

00:47.640 --> 00:51.140
<i>She's so cute, I can't help 
but want to have a picture.</i>

00:51.140 --> 00:53.180
<i>Don't do it! It's not right!</i>

00:54.950 --> 00:56.690
<i>What is she doing?</i>

00:57.150 --> 00:59.460
<i>She's playing with a cat?</i>

01:01.380 --> 01:03.830
<i>Nope, that's a plastic bag.</i>

01:05.140 --> 01:06.880
<i>She's forgotten her glasses again.</i>

01:06.880 --> 01:08.080
<i>That's right.</i>

01:08.080 --> 01:09.840
<i>She'd forgotten her glasses again today.</i>

01:10.320 --> 01:11.470
<i>This is bad.</i>

01:11.470 --> 01:15.840
<i>She's going to be so embarrassed 
when she learns the truth.</i>

01:16.080 --> 01:18.840
You don't meow at all, do you?

01:28.620 --> 01:29.900
Oh, there you go.

01:31.250 --> 01:34.120
You're kinda crumply, aren't you?

01:34.550 --> 01:35.890
<i>Don't pet it!</i>

01:35.890 --> 01:37.400
<i>You'll find out!</i>

01:38.040 --> 01:40.400
Oh, look, a kitty over here, too.

01:40.400 --> 01:41.370
Pat, pat.

01:43.750 --> 01:44.890
Huh?

01:44.890 --> 01:46.370
Komura-kun?

01:46.620 --> 01:49.380
Did you just see a kitty here?

01:54.880 --> 01:55.780
Meow.

02:04.780 --> 02:05.860
The Girl I Like 
her Glasses

02:05.860 --> 02:08.870
The Girl I Like 
Forgot her Glasses

03:30.230 --> 03:34.610
Episode 3

03:30.230 --> 03:34.610
The Girl I Like

03:30.230 --> 03:34.610
Picked Up A Love Letter

03:36.930 --> 03:38.490
Which one is it?

03:38.490 --> 03:39.540
Looking for something?

03:39.540 --> 03:40.530
Yeah.

03:41.120 --> 03:42.940
<i>It's in your bag, right?</i>

03:43.430 --> 03:44.100
Yeah.

03:45.820 --> 03:47.030
I'll help you find it.

03:48.830 --> 03:51.000
<i>Th-That's Azuma-kun.</i>

03:51.620 --> 03:54.290
<i>The ridiculously popular, 
good-looking Azuma-kun.</i>

03:56.160 --> 03:59.550
<i>And he's helping Mie-san find something 
because she doesn't have her glasses!</i>

03:59.970 --> 04:01.540
Oh, is this it?

04:01.540 --> 04:02.640
Which one?

04:14.060 --> 04:15.120
This one.

04:20.990 --> 04:22.280
Oh, it's this one.

04:23.210 --> 04:24.520
<i>Bleh...</i>

04:27.000 --> 04:29.540
<i>Wait, what do I mean, "bleh"?</i>

04:30.170 --> 04:32.950
<i>Am I upset that Mie-san's 
being friendly with someone?</i>

04:32.950 --> 04:35.710
<i>Am I really being that full of myself?</i>

04:35.710 --> 04:37.570
<i>Stop it. Stop it!</i>

04:37.570 --> 04:39.710
<i>Stop having nasty feelings!</i>

04:40.240 --> 04:42.000
Thanks for always helping me,

04:42.560 --> 04:43.470
Komura-kun.

04:48.270 --> 04:49.950
Nah, I'm Azuma.

04:51.430 --> 04:54.040
What, why did you think I was Komura-kun?

04:54.040 --> 04:55.360
Sorry, sorry.

04:55.360 --> 04:56.980
You're right, your hair's black.

04:57.910 --> 05:02.240
Komura-kun's usually the guy 
that helps me out, so...

05:02.240 --> 05:05.690
You weren't thinking it'd be anyone 
else from the beginning, huh?

05:05.690 --> 05:07.990
I thought you were Komura-kun.

05:07.990 --> 05:10.990
I got so casual with you.

05:11.620 --> 05:13.000
I'm so embarrassed.

05:23.510 --> 05:25.280
M-Morning, Mie-san.

05:25.280 --> 05:27.920
That's you, right? Komura-kun.

05:28.350 --> 05:29.510
Morning.

05:38.170 --> 05:39.150
Morning!

05:39.150 --> 05:40.020
Morning.

05:45.760 --> 05:47.160
Morning.

05:47.160 --> 05:49.680
Mie-chan, did you forget your glasses <i>again</i>?

05:49.680 --> 05:51.740
Why do you keep forgetting them?

05:52.290 --> 05:55.010
I mean, by the time I notice,
I've already forgotten.

05:55.010 --> 05:56.250
Jeez!

05:56.550 --> 06:00.420
I'm so worried you're going to end 
up with permanent frown lines.

06:00.420 --> 06:04.250
You look like you're glaring 
at people without your glasses.

06:10.210 --> 06:11.380
Wrinkles...

06:11.640 --> 06:12.890
Wrinkles...

06:14.700 --> 06:15.770
Wrinkles...

06:16.580 --> 06:17.490
Morning.

06:17.590 --> 06:18.520
Morning.

06:19.600 --> 06:22.890
<i>I wonder if Mie-san has her glasses today.</i>

06:30.000 --> 06:31.120
Komura! Morning.

06:31.120 --> 06:32.160
Morning.

06:33.220 --> 06:34.450
Morning, Mie-san.

06:57.460 --> 06:58.870
Nope, never mind.

06:58.870 --> 07:00.230
It's too hard to see.

07:00.760 --> 07:05.440
I thought I could try not 
to furrow my eyebrows...

07:05.440 --> 07:07.610
Oh, morning, Komura-kun.

07:06.560 --> 07:08.810
I'm using a pedometer app.

07:08.250 --> 07:10.270
M-Morning.

07:09.470 --> 07:10.960
That's an idea.

07:10.960 --> 07:12.030
Right?

07:12.030 --> 07:12.960
Yeah.

07:39.940 --> 07:45.740
And that was to become a 
lifelong memory for Komura-kun

07:40.490 --> 07:44.410
<i>And that was to become a 
lifelong memory for Komura-kun.</i>

07:46.380 --> 07:48.650
Komura-kun, shiritori, starting with Ri.

07:49.120 --> 07:49.790
Huh?

07:55.070 --> 07:59.830
I played shiritori with Asuka-chan 
the other day, but I kept losing.

08:00.760 --> 08:04.420
I want to get better at it. Please play me.

08:04.710 --> 08:06.860
B-But...

08:07.270 --> 08:10.240
<i>Doesn't that mean I'd be 
trading words with Mie-san?</i>

08:10.240 --> 08:11.420
<i>Oh, boy.</i>

08:11.420 --> 08:14.430
<i>He's so fixated on shiritori 
that it's creepy.</i>

08:14.430 --> 08:15.550
R-Rin<b>go</b> (apple).

08:16.910 --> 08:18.180
G-Goril<b>la</b>.

08:18.780 --> 08:19.580
Rap<b>pa</b> (trumpet).

08:20.160 --> 08:21.840
P-Papri<b>ka</b>.

08:21.840 --> 08:23.600
Kansu<b>u</b> (functions).

08:24.970 --> 08:25.940
Umiu<b>shi</b> (sea slug).

08:27.780 --> 08:29.270
You're going too easy on me.

08:30.610 --> 08:33.220
Why aren't you hitting me 
with a <i>ru</i> or something?

08:34.400 --> 08:36.670
I can't improve!

08:36.670 --> 08:40.080
You can bully me more, Komura-kun!

08:40.080 --> 08:41.450
<i>You can't say that!</i>

08:43.350 --> 08:45.330
Okay, then...

08:45.630 --> 08:48.410
Why don't we try going faster?

08:48.410 --> 08:49.040
Yeah.

08:50.790 --> 08:51.760
Shishima<b>i</b>.

08:51.760 --> 08:53.760
I... In<b>ko</b> (budgie).

08:54.000 --> 08:55.030
Kougo<b>u</b> (empress).

08:55.030 --> 08:56.570
U-Ushigae<b>ru</b> (bullfrog).

08:56.570 --> 08:57.780
Roulet<b>te</b>.

08:57.780 --> 08:59.010
T-Ton<b>bi</b> (black kite).

08:59.010 --> 08:59.970
Bikkuriba<b>ko</b> (jack-in-the-box).

09:00.210 --> 09:01.970
K-Komura-ku<b>n</b>.

09:01.970 --> 09:03.480
Y-Yes?!

09:12.030 --> 09:13.890
I ended on an <i>n</i>.

09:13.890 --> 09:14.990
I lose.

09:21.040 --> 09:21.820
No.

09:22.720 --> 09:24.110
You won.

09:29.790 --> 09:31.040
See you tomorrow.

09:31.040 --> 09:32.000
Bye.

09:41.510 --> 09:44.520
I'm almost done over here. I think.

09:44.520 --> 09:47.120
Not that I can see.

09:47.120 --> 09:48.520
Okay. Thanks.

09:49.160 --> 09:53.370
<i>Even cleaning duty is blissful 
when I'm with Mie-san.</i>

09:54.170 --> 09:55.920
<i>Although the others are here, too.</i>

09:57.340 --> 09:59.450
Cocky-cocky...

10:01.480 --> 10:04.410
Cocky-cocky...

10:08.920 --> 10:11.920
<i>I-It's a c-word!</i>

10:12.920 --> 10:14.420
<i>Wh-What do I do?</i>

10:14.420 --> 10:17.170
<i>I shouldn't just straight-up 
tell her there's a c-word here.</i>

10:17.980 --> 10:21.370
<i>Mie-san's forgotten her glasses, after all.</i>

10:21.370 --> 10:26.850
<i>If someone told me there's a c-word 
nearby when I'm blindfolded...</i>

10:26.850 --> 10:29.020
<i>I'd totally panic.</i>

10:31.820 --> 10:33.090
M-Mie-san...

10:34.400 --> 10:36.030
Could you come over here?

10:39.030 --> 10:40.960
Th-That's it.

10:40.960 --> 10:41.870
Slowly.

10:51.630 --> 10:52.990
What's up?

10:52.990 --> 10:54.780
N-No...

10:57.510 --> 10:58.800
Cockroach!

11:02.260 --> 11:03.230
Where?!

11:03.230 --> 11:04.720
Where is it, Komura-kun?!

11:04.720 --> 11:05.750
Where?!

11:04.720 --> 11:06.770
Buh... buh...

11:07.580 --> 11:09.200
<i>We panicked.</i>

11:23.610 --> 11:25.240
Morning, Komura-kun.

11:25.240 --> 11:27.290
I forgot my glasses again.

11:27.660 --> 11:30.790
<i>After all this time, she's finally 
going for the classic klutz move.</i>

11:30.790 --> 11:32.320
Hey, Mie-san...

11:32.790 --> 11:33.680
Your forehead.

11:33.680 --> 11:34.790
My forehead?

11:38.150 --> 11:40.940
Th-Thank goodness they aren't broken.

11:40.940 --> 11:43.260
Sorry. I didn't know they were on my forehead.

11:43.840 --> 11:47.450
Good thing you hadn't forgotten 
your glasses, though, huh?

11:47.450 --> 11:48.270
Umm...

11:50.370 --> 11:51.770
Please and thank you.

11:58.160 --> 11:59.810
<i>I-Is she waiting for a kiss?!</i>

11:59.810 --> 12:01.100
<i>No, that can't be it.</i>

12:02.400 --> 12:03.430
Please and thank you.

12:03.430 --> 12:04.640
Here you go.

12:04.640 --> 12:06.830
<i>Oh, right, she wants me to put them on.</i>

12:07.800 --> 12:10.260
<i>Th-That's also kinda...</i>

12:10.260 --> 12:12.940
<i>Err, not that it's weird or anything, but...</i>

12:30.260 --> 12:31.300
Thanks.

12:37.230 --> 12:38.400
Komura-kun?

12:46.420 --> 12:49.240
No, I really can't.

12:49.240 --> 12:51.230
I'm not even in the same class.

12:51.230 --> 12:52.930
How do I deliver it?

12:52.930 --> 12:55.250
I'm sure you can think of something.

12:55.250 --> 12:56.570
Come on, let's go.

12:56.570 --> 12:58.640
Wait up!

13:12.120 --> 13:13.020
Mie-san.

13:13.340 --> 13:14.890
Oh, Komura-kun.

13:15.370 --> 13:17.340
It looks like a letter.

13:17.340 --> 13:18.400
I picked it up.

13:18.710 --> 13:19.640
A letter?

13:19.640 --> 13:21.190
Do you know whose it is?

13:21.910 --> 13:25.590
It'll be quicker if you looked at it.

13:25.590 --> 13:27.700
<i>She's forgotten her glasses again, huh?</i>

13:28.440 --> 13:30.690
<i>I don't know if I should 
read someone's letter...</i>

13:31.200 --> 13:33.500
<i>Although, I'm not looking inside.</i>

13:34.140 --> 13:36.820
<i>And I won't know who dropped 
it unless I look at the name.</i>

13:37.710 --> 13:40.590
To Azuma Ren-kun

13:40.930 --> 13:42.890
<i>I-It's...</i>

13:43.530 --> 13:46.250
<i>The hot man with unrivaled 
popularity among the girls!</i>

13:46.250 --> 13:48.910
<i>A letter to our classmate, Azuma-kun!</i>

13:50.430 --> 13:54.430
<i>A-And this obviously deliberately
chosen heart sticker...</i>

13:54.770 --> 13:56.850
<i>It's a love letter!</i>

13:56.850 --> 13:58.690
Who did it say?

14:00.760 --> 14:02.700
It doesn't say who it's from.

14:02.700 --> 14:04.180
It just says it's for Azuma-kun.

14:04.180 --> 14:05.190
Azuma-kun, huh?

14:06.250 --> 14:07.400
Thanks.

14:15.580 --> 14:18.580
<b>Class 2-B</b>

14:17.710 --> 14:18.580
What?

14:18.960 --> 14:20.420
So I'm hooked on goldfish...

14:18.960 --> 14:22.490
Azuma-kun, where are you?

14:22.490 --> 14:23.840
I'm over here.

14:30.610 --> 14:31.350
Here.

14:34.260 --> 14:35.120
For me?

14:36.330 --> 14:37.410
From you?

14:37.410 --> 14:38.880
<i>N-N-No!</i>

14:38.880 --> 14:40.030
<i>"For me?" yes.</i>

14:40.030 --> 14:41.150
<i>But, "From you?" no!</i>

14:41.440 --> 14:42.480
Bye.

14:43.250 --> 14:44.900
<i>Don't do this to me!</i>

15:01.630 --> 15:03.250
What's gotten into everyone?

15:03.250 --> 15:04.850
<i>This is bad...</i>

15:04.850 --> 15:06.700
<i>This is seriously bad.</i>

15:05.940 --> 15:07.610
Mie-chan! Mie-chan!

15:09.020 --> 15:10.830
Are you going for Azuma-kun, too?

15:10.830 --> 15:12.700
What about Azuma-kun?

15:12.700 --> 15:15.430
I'm asking, do you <i>like</i> Azuma-kun?

15:15.430 --> 15:16.600
<i>No, no!</i>

15:16.600 --> 15:18.480
<i>It's a minor misunderstanding!</i>

15:18.480 --> 15:20.550
<i>It's a false alarm!</i>

15:22.440 --> 15:25.440
Well, I guess I like him.

15:28.830 --> 15:31.360
<i>I'm sure she means </i>like<i> and not </i>love<i>...</i>

15:31.360 --> 15:34.380
<i>But you're going to turn this 
false alarm into a forest fire!</i>

15:36.330 --> 15:39.280
Gonna go read it, Azuma?

15:39.280 --> 15:40.580
Don't follow me.

15:41.820 --> 15:43.050
<i>Right!</i>

15:43.050 --> 15:46.590
<i>It should say who it's from in the letter.</i>

15:48.870 --> 15:50.720
<i>Staaare...</i>

15:58.720 --> 16:01.440
<i>Know that it's a misunderstanding, Azuma-kun.</i>

16:01.440 --> 16:03.290
<i>Know your place, damn you!</i>

16:03.290 --> 16:06.230
<i>Komura-kun is being slightly 
foul-mouthed because he's so tense.</i>

16:03.290 --> 16:06.230
Komura-kun 
is being slightly 
foul-mouthed 
because he's 
so tense.

16:14.240 --> 16:16.240
<i>Wh-What's going on?!</i>

16:16.880 --> 16:18.360
<i>Did he figure it out?</i>

16:18.360 --> 16:21.160
<i>Or is he still confused because 
the sender's name isn't on there?</i>

16:21.750 --> 16:23.000
<i>Damn it!</i>

16:23.000 --> 16:26.710
<i>I'm not good-looking enough to know 
how good-looking people think.</i>

16:26.960 --> 16:30.480
I never would have thought 
you liked Azuma-kun.

16:30.480 --> 16:32.470
Let us know if it gets somewhere.

16:32.470 --> 16:34.360
<i>I said she doesn't!</i>

16:34.360 --> 16:36.470
<i>She doesn't, damn it!</i>

16:43.190 --> 16:44.440
<i>Shit!</i>

16:44.880 --> 16:47.500
<i>How do I clear up this misunderstanding?</i>

16:52.270 --> 16:54.720
<i>What if it isn't a misunderstanding?</i>

17:00.030 --> 17:00.950
<i>No...</i>

17:00.950 --> 17:03.510
<i>I mean, it's Azuma-kun.</i>

17:03.510 --> 17:04.790
<i>He's attractive.</i>

17:04.790 --> 17:07.020
<i>He's good at sports and 
he does well at school.</i>

17:07.020 --> 17:08.000
<i>He's kind.</i>

17:09.000 --> 17:11.930
<i>And I think he has a German Shepherd.</i>

17:12.850 --> 17:16.920
<i>I shouldn't be surprised 
if she does like him.</i>

17:19.570 --> 17:23.520
<i>Why am I even getting so desperate, anyway?</i>

17:30.970 --> 17:32.100
Hey, hey...

17:38.460 --> 17:40.010
Wh-What?!

17:40.010 --> 17:41.120
What's wrong?

17:41.940 --> 17:42.880
Are you okay?

17:42.880 --> 17:43.950
Are you crying?

17:45.450 --> 17:46.240
I'm fine.

17:46.240 --> 17:47.660
I'm not crying. I'm fine.

17:48.100 --> 17:48.960
Okay.

17:55.310 --> 17:58.030
H-Hey, Mie-san...

17:58.480 --> 18:01.470
What do you think of Azuma-kun?

18:02.320 --> 18:03.660
You, too?

18:03.660 --> 18:06.670
Why is everyone asking me about Azuma-kun?

18:06.670 --> 18:08.270
Well, I mean...

18:09.740 --> 18:12.350
<i>Why am I even asking?</i>

18:12.810 --> 18:14.390
N-Never mind.

18:14.390 --> 18:15.190
Sorry.

18:15.190 --> 18:16.990
You don't have to answer.

18:16.990 --> 18:20.160
I like Azuma-kun.

18:20.160 --> 18:22.490
Y-Yeah?

18:24.090 --> 18:26.770
<i>What kind of </i>like<i> is it?</i>

18:28.420 --> 18:33.500
I'd get it if people were 
asking if I like you, but...

18:38.080 --> 18:40.220
Wh-Why's that?

18:41.220 --> 18:41.840
Huh?

18:41.840 --> 18:45.220
You know, I've gotten so attached to you.

18:45.570 --> 18:48.670
And I actually like you, after all.

18:49.230 --> 18:52.230
And I actually like you, after all.

18:52.470 --> 18:55.510
And I actually like you, after all.

18:53.230 --> 18:58.700
<i>What kind of </i>like<i> is that?</i>

18:55.730 --> 18:58.700
And I actually like you, after all.

19:03.530 --> 19:04.240
Mie-san.

19:09.160 --> 19:10.330
My reply.

19:13.030 --> 19:14.760
<i>She got a reply!</i>

19:14.760 --> 19:16.590
<i>Now what do I do?!</i>

19:18.440 --> 19:19.760
For me?

19:25.720 --> 19:29.040
Sorry, Komura-kun, could you read it for me?

19:32.000 --> 19:34.270
<i>N-No, but...</i>

19:36.030 --> 19:39.280
<i>Should I really be reading a 
reply to someone's love letter?</i>

19:39.570 --> 19:41.280
Could you, Komura-kun?

19:41.790 --> 19:43.360
<i>What the hell?!</i>

19:43.360 --> 19:46.280
<i>I seriously don't get hot guys!</i>

19:49.570 --> 19:50.750
<i>Now what?</i>

19:51.200 --> 19:53.610
<i>What if he accepts her?</i>

19:53.610 --> 19:57.800
<i>Although, if he doesn't, I'd probably 
go beast mode Hannyamaru on him.</i>

20:17.240 --> 20:19.820
Komura-kun likes you, too, Mie-san.

20:19.820 --> 20:22.320
<b>Komura-kun</b>

20:30.050 --> 20:32.460
Azuma-kun, what did you reply?

20:32.910 --> 20:37.500
Actually, Mie-san delivered 
someone's letter for them.

20:37.500 --> 20:38.800
That's it?

20:39.040 --> 20:40.490
So I just returned the favor.

20:45.840 --> 20:47.020
Komura-kun.

20:47.440 --> 20:48.790
Y-Yes?

20:48.790 --> 20:50.530
What did it say?

21:01.820 --> 21:02.890
Err...

21:03.530 --> 21:06.280
It said, "Thanks for delivering the letter."

21:06.280 --> 21:07.260
Oh.

21:21.500 --> 21:23.210
Could you, Komura-kun?

21:27.700 --> 21:30.760
And I actually like you, after all.

21:33.770 --> 21:39.990
Thus,

21:33.770 --> 21:39.990
Komura-kun's 
fear of
attractive

21:33.770 --> 21:39.990
and absent-minded 
people was reinforced.

21:34.240 --> 21:39.980
<i>Thus, Komura-kun's fear of attractive and 
absent-minded people was reinforced.</i>

23:10.690 --> 23:11.700
Komura Kaede here.

23:11.700 --> 23:13.550
I'm doing the next episode preview.

23:13.550 --> 23:15.200
I'm not freaking out anymore.

23:15.200 --> 23:16.790
Don't freak out, me.

23:19.540 --> 23:23.420
Mie-san asks Komura-kun 
to pick out her glasses.

23:23.700 --> 23:25.550
What kind of situation is that?!

23:25.550 --> 23:27.760
How am I not supposed to freak out?!

23:27.760 --> 23:32.810
I'm not going to get in huge trouble or anything to 
